<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχήλ-ᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheel-drawn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1001
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					49
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dragged by</i> or <i>at the wheels,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαγαὶ Ἕκτορος τροχήλατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					399
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ploughed with wheels,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελεύθου τρίοδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					173
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>formed on the potter's wheel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Xenarch.
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> metaph.,
				<i>hurried along like a wheel</i> or <i>chariot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				122
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. μανία</span>
			<i>whirling</i> madness, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				82
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
